+### Automatic export in colocated workspaces
+
+By default, colocated workspaces automatically export bookmarks and tags to Git
+after each mutating `jj` command.
+
+You can disable that behavior by setting:
+
+```toml
+[git]
+auto-export = false
+```
+
+When disabled, Git refs may become stale until you run `jj git export`
+manually. This can be useful in repos with many refs where ref export is slow.
+
 ### Default remotes for `jj git fetch` and `jj git push`
 
 By default, if a single remote exists it is used for `jj git fetch` and `jj git
